title: 'pallet-dap: mark funds as inactive  and expect buffer account to be pre-funded'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    In pallet-dap, mark funds in the issuance buffer as inactive so they do not participate in governance.
    In production, the buffer account must be pre-funded (e.g., via genesis allocation or transfer) before the migration runs.
crates:
- name: pallet-dap
  bump: patch
